  1109→As $B$ accumulates, R2 rapidly comes to dominate both $\lambda_{\max}$ and $\Phi_{\mathrm{total}}$, keeping $\kappa \approx 1$ throughout the simulation.
  1110→By Corollary~\ref{cor:expansion-depth} with $\varepsilon_{\Delta t} = 0.01$, this gives $d_{\min} = \lceil \kappa\,\varepsilon_{\Delta t} \rceil = 1$, so we set \texttt{expansion\_depth = 1}.
